      // no stars, intro cards of what it opens are marked seen (P.setReachedLevel). An older client ignores the field.
      // 0.10.5 Golpe de Suerte: `drop: { start 0-3, taps? }` (HQ / mail / codes) -> one chest into P.drops (a Botín drop;
      // gap M6). An older client ignores the field
