  // 0.10.3 TIERS: rows other modules add to the popup ({ id, order, render(el, { lang }), close() after the popup closes }:
  // shell/quality-ui.js the tier row). quality-ui.js called row() since 0.9.0 but nothing here rendered it (A-PERF H12)
